<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  Dev round 10 (D-04/D-05): capabilities for the iOS target only.
  - iCloud key-value store: syncs playlists + settings (never
    passwords; passwords stay in the local Keychain). No custom
    CloudKit container is created — NSUbiquitousKeyValueStore only.
  - CarPlay audio: the car screen shows the channel list and plays
    audio (see CarPlayScene.swift).
  - CarPlay video (dev round 17, R17-01): video browsing + playback
    on iOS 26.4+ in cars that support the video-in-car feature,
    parked only (WWDC 2026 session 212; key documented in iOS 27
    API tables). Declared ALONGSIDE carplay-audio, never instead
    of it — content that suits both keeps both entitlements. The
    video key needs Apple approval and a signed build to take
    effect, and the vehicle must support video-in-car; neither is
    verifiable in this repo's unsigned CI build.
  UNVERIFIED: this repo's CI builds unsigned (CODE_SIGNING_ALLOWED=NO),
  so whether these entitlements take effect under a real signed
  build cannot be proven here — a signed-build verification item.
  Without an iCloud environment the app silently stays local and
  never loses local data (see ICloudSync.swift).
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>com.apple.developer.ubiquity-kvstore-identifier</key>
	<string>$(TeamIdentifierPrefix)$(CFBundleIdentifier)</string>
	<key>com.apple.developer.carplay-audio</key>
	<true/>
	<key>com.apple.developer.carplay-video</key>
	<true/>
</dict>
</plist>
